# Cloudflare Pages already serves game.html at /game and play.html at /play ("clean URLs"):
# a request for /game.html is redirected (308) to /game.
#
# The old rules here were
#     /game  /game.html  200
#     /play  /play.html  200
# which loop forever: /game is proxied to /game.html, Pages redirects /game.html back to /game,
# and the browser gives up with ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS (that is why PLAY GAME showed
# "redirected you too many times"). So no rules are needed for these two pages.
#
# Only add rules below for URLs that do NOT map to an existing file.
